name plain-widow
category Package
revision 75230
shortdesc Three output routines that extend \plainoutput
longdesc This package contains three output routines that extend
longdesc \plainoutput. The first adds a reporting of problematic lines,
longdesc i.e., for widow, club, and broken lines. The second prevents
longdesc widow lines by changing the \vsize by one line. The third tries
longdesc to avoid widow, club, and broken lines as much as possible for
longdesc spreads.
